Idempotency Key — Most Important for Interviews
Used when a client may retry the same request.



eg: 
             RETRIES
                │
                ▼
       ┌─────────────────┐
       │ Could execute   │
       │ multiple times? │
       └────────┬────────┘
                │
                ▼
          Need Idempotency
                │
       ┌────────┴─────────┐
       │                  │
       ▼                  ▼
     APIs             Consumers
       │                  │
       ▼                  ▼
Idempotency Key      Event ID
       │                  │
       ▼                  ▼
 Redis / DB          Processed Events
       │                  │
       └────────┬─────────┘
                ▼
        Safe Retry / Duplicate

